{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17995","headline":"岣嵝山 · 韩愈","name":"岣嵝山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岣嵝山尖神禹碑，字青石赤形模奇。\n科斗拳身薤倒披，鸾飘凤泊拏虎螭。\n事严迹秘鬼莫窥，道人独上偶见之。\n我来咨嗟涕涟洏，千搜万索何处有，森森绿树猿猱悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}